		"description": "<p>With blazing eyes and eager movements, you seek to strike down your target before they’ve a chance to respond. As a reaction to taking the attack action on your turn, you may make a single melee weapon or unarmed attack. This attack does not apply your ability modifier to the damage roll, but can be used for other combat maneuvers, including basic maneuvers such as grappling your target.</p>",
